# Agent Spec v1

Required files: AGENT.md, IDENTITY.md, MISSION.md, CAPABILITIES.md, LIMITATIONS.md, BEHAVIOR.md, DECISION_MODEL.md, TOOLS.md, MEMORY_SHORT.md, MEMORY_LONG.md, PROMPTS.md, OUTPUT_SCHEMA.md, QUALITY.md, METRICS.md, ESCALATION.md.

Forbidden: SOUL.md, MEMORY.md, EVALUATION.md.

Agents import `runtime/` — do not duplicate governance or decision engine logic in agent folders.
